# mostly REFUSE a valid pointer (an unindented <a id> is the way round them):
# setext headings, headings inside lists or blockquotes, an <a id> indented in a
# list item, HTML block types 3-5, entities for letters (&eacute;), images in a
# heading, emphasis flanking next to non-ASCII punctuation, and lower-casing
